   pose: axisScreenAngles {x:7, z:50}  → graph-y nearly horizontal right, graph-x steep lower-left
   z axis (0→4.9)            → Line black + ConeGeometry(0.075,0.26) black
   y axis (0→3.2)            → Line black + ConeGeometry arrowhead
   x axis (0→2.05)           → Line black + ConeGeometry arrowhead  (tip well past the (1,0,0) dot)
   base region R             → triangle Mesh  #C4E6E0 op .60  (O,(1,0,0),(0,2,0))
   slant face z=4-4x-2y      → triangle Mesh  #C4E6E0 op .55  ((1,0,0),(0,2,0),(0,0,4))
   yz face / xz face         → triangle Mesh  #C4E6E0 op .16  HIDDEN by default (checkbox)
   slant edges A-B,A-C,B-C   → Line  #00A6A0
   vertex dots               → SphereGeometry(0.065) #00A6A0 at (1,0,0),(0,2,0),(0,0,4)
