   slicing plane z=c         → triangle Mesh #8FCFC8 op .30 + Line outline #00A6A0  (c>0 only)
   2D inset (billboarded, scale 1.2, screen-right of 3D, sharing its baseline)
                             → flat quads/ShapeGeometry: axes black + triangle arrowheads,
                               region fill #C4E6E0, hypotenuse quad #00A6A0, CircleGeometry dots,
                               thin red strip quad #F4525A + hover-only round handle
